        "eyebrow": "Meet the team",
        "heading": "The people behind the grain.",
        "text": "<p><strong>Stephen & Micah Hilsdon — Owner & Operator</strong></p><p>Specialty Rice Inc. is still a family-owned business, run by Stephen and Micah Hilsdon of Brinkley, Arkansas. They both are from this town and have been in the rice industry and the community their whole lives.</p><p>When the opportunity arose to purchase the company, their decision was driven by one clear purpose: protect local jobs and keep the business rooted in Brinkley. The employees of Specialty Rice are more than coworkers, they are friends, neighbours, and extended family.</p><p><strong>Tammy Roberts — Office Manager</strong></p><p><strong>Kiana — Quality</strong></p>",
