      "settings": {
        "anchor": "impact",
        "eyebrow": "Our impact",
        "heading": "Rooted in the land and community.",
        "text": "<p>As lifelong members of the farming community, Stephen and Micah deeply value the growers who partner with them. They are committed to helping farmers receive fair, competitive pricing for the rice they produce, recognizing that strong farms build strong communities.</p><p>The company is investing increasingly in regenerative rice practices, which are designed to improve soil health, conserve water, and minimize environmental impact. By doing so, the company ensures that future generations can continue farming the land productively and sustainably.</p>",
